{"1965270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SUFFOCATE", "steam_appid": 1965270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/extras/1d52faa05310faf47c337bab2a9e57d6.poster.avif?t=1786446090\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/extras/1d52faa05310faf47c337bab2a9e57d6.webm?t=1786446090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/extras/1d52faa05310faf47c337bab2a9e57d6.mp4?t=1786446090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《SUFFOCATE》is a realistic 3D first-person survival horror game. Set in the present day, the plot revolves around family relationships, a mysterious cult, and the greed that permeates human nature. The game doesn't shy away from violence, gore, and faith  in this one-of-a-kind survival horror experience, Taiwanese style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance the plot by exploring, hiding, and solving puzzles, and experience a horror story centered around family relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/extras/1c06b78415300799e0ca2aa63dace28b.poster.avif?t=1786446090\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/extras/1c06b78415300799e0ca2aa63dace28b.webm?t=1786446090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/extras/1c06b78415300799e0ca2aa63dace28b.mp4?t=1786446090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in modern Taiwan,about family relationships,politics and religion.  How a family fall into darkness, the unbearable truth awaits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/extras/2bdbd5f6d74a9f7a7b040446564dd2ab.poster.avif?t=1786446090\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/extras/2bdbd5f6d74a9f7a7b040446564dd2ab.webm?t=1786446090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/extras/2bdbd5f6d74a9f7a7b040446564dd2ab.mp4?t=1786446090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/extras/5fef4ae85d24d805c24d4bee24bb75c1.poster.avif?t=1786446090\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/extras/5fef4ae85d24d805c24d4bee24bb75c1.webm?t=1786446090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/extras/5fef4ae85d24d805c24d4bee24bb75c1.mp4?t=1786446090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/extras/a722d3ec159a5e75b288515475cca5fb.poster.avif?t=1786446090\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/extras/a722d3ec159a5e75b288515475cca5fb.webm?t=1786446090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/extras/a722d3ec159a5e75b288515475cca5fb.mp4?t=1786446090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore, solve puzzles, and hide to advance the plot, and lift the veil of mystery on an eerie mansion. If you enjoy horror games, you won't want to miss this!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense, thrilling parkour chases as you flee from relentless angry ghosts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzles that are closely integrated with the story.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping plot full of suspense and horror, and a story that cuts to the heart of family relationships.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced in vivid fashion by professional voice actors.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic Taiwanese culture on full display in a never-before-seen Taiwanese-style survival horror game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full 5 hours of enthralling gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《SUFFOCATE》 contains violence, gore, sexual content, and strong language. Please play with caution.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/extras/1d52faa05310faf47c337bab2a9e57d6.poster.avif?t=1786446090\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/extras/1d52faa05310faf47c337bab2a9e57d6.webm?t=1786446090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse