_paragraph\" >A gripping plot full of suspense and horror, and a story that cuts to the heart of family relationships.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced in vivid fashion by professional voice actors.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic Taiwanese culture on full display in a never-before-seen Taiwanese-style survival horror game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full 5 hours of enthralling gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《SUFFOCATE》 contains violence, gore, sexual content, and strong language. Please play with caution.</p>", "short_description": "《SUFFOCATE》is a realistic 3D first-person survival horror game. The plot revolves around family relationships, cult, and the greed that permeates human nature. The game doesn't shy away from violence, gore, and faith in this one-of-a-kind survival horror experience, Taiwanese style.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Korean, German, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/header.jpg?t=1786446090", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/fe54c2476dd9cf827a48da0d218a8bfe16bf244f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786446090", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965270/fe54c2476dd9cf827a48da0d218a8bfe16bf244f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786446090", "website": "https://naughtycowgames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:<